WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.420
We were a little apprehensive.

2
00:00:01.420 --> 00:00:03.360
We really didn’t know what they were going to do.

3
00:00:03.360 --> 00:00:08.560
During the sit-ins, sometimes you might get beat, sometimes they’d pour coffee on you, or anything.

4
00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:11.300
We had no idea what they might do to us.

5
00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:18.580
But we were willing to do whatever we needed to do to bring it to the attention of the nation, I guess you might say.
